<h2 id="part-a-2">2. Conditional generation and guidance</h2>
<section id="part-a-2-1"><h3>2.1 Classifier-free guidance (CFG)</h3>
<p>I evaluated the conditional and empty-prompt velocities at the same image and time, then used vCFG = v꜀ + w(v꜀ − vᵤ). The supplied check confirmed that w = 0 reproduces ordinary conditional prediction. The results below use w = 7 and exactly the same initial noises as above. Faces are more coherent and the outputs look more like studio portraits. These five results still concentrate on people, so this prompt gives limited subject diversity.</p>
