<p>I mixed each input with the same seed-180 noise at the selected starting time, then integrated to t = 1 with CFG. Every panel includes the original and all seven starts: 0.02, 0.04, 0.06, 0.10, 0.14, 0.25, and 0.50. The prompt is <code>"a high quality photo"</code>. Smaller starting times leave less input information and allow larger changes.</p>
